  "contract": "Brutal Swing rank 2 (500996) and Decapitate rank 2 (806905) carry an EquippedItemInventoryTypeMask that their own EquippedItemSubClassMask contradicts: the subclass list admits one-handed axes, maces, swords, fists, daggers and spears, but the slot mask accepts only a two-handed weapon. A Barbarian wielding a one-handed weapon therefore gets SPELL_FAILED_EQUIPPED_ITEM_CLASS (29) from rank 2 onwards while rank 1 (500913, 804414) succeeds. Every rank of both chains must accept the same one-handed weapon, and every rank must still refuse to cast with no weapon equipped. Decapitate is only usable on enemies below 35% health (TargetAuraState, checked before the weapon requirement), so both targets are lowered to 30% before any Decapitate cast.",
